---
title: "to_coin (Sui Framework: token)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_destruct: Token(id, balance) destructured
    q_destruct --> q_delete: id.delete()
    q_delete --> q_convert: balance.into_coin(ctx)
    q_convert --> q_create_request: new_request(to_coin_action, amount, none, none)
    q_create_request --> [*]: return (Coin, ActionRequest)

    note right of q_convert
        INV-001: token is destroyed, coin is created with same balance
        INV-002: ActionRequest must be confirmed (closed-loop to open-loop transition)
        INV-003: total supply unchanged - only representation changes
    end note
